## 定理四：Toeplitz 矩阵是历史态的时钟约化密度矩阵

构造

$$
\boxed{
|\Psi_N\rangle
=
\frac1{\sqrt{N+1}}
\sum_{t=0}^{N}
|t\rangle\otimes U^t|v\rangle.
}
\tag{23}
$$

那么

$$
\boxed{
\rho_{\mathrm{clock}}
=
\operatorname{Tr}_{\mathrm{data}}
|\Psi_N\rangle\langle\Psi_N|
=
\frac{T_N}{N+1}.
}
\tag{24}
$$

END_RAW_TEXT
